  "design": "Two-story: concrete-block ground floor with a cab and catwalk; an R4 adaptation of a flat-roof design similar to R6. A 1958 item describes a glass cab on a cinder-block base about ten feet high, built for a man and wife lookout team.",
  "height_m": null,
